*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 73.33~80 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,400f</sup>.
*4 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
