==Strategy==
The easiest way to beat this stage is to simply cheese it. In the beginning of the level spawn [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to get some money. After the Doge Dark dies, start meatshielding and spawn [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]. Once Octopus is near the Kory spawn [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] who should quickly kill the Kory and other peons. At this point Berserkory should have spawned so use your breakerblast to knock him behind the base and let Bahamut and your other cats damage the base with Octopus blocking Berserkory's waves. If you do everything right the enemy base should die right before Bun Bun Black spawns in.

==Trivia==
*Since all other [[Phantasmagoria]] stages are named after mythical creatures, Taurus Trail (タウロス街道, Taurosu Kaidō, "Taurus Highway") presumably refers to the [[wikipedia:Minotaur|Minotaur]] (ミノタウロス ''Minotaurosu'') or [[wikipedia:Centaur|centaur]] (ケンタウロス ''kentaurosu''). This could be a subtle reference to [[Labyrinth of Hades]], another stage with [[Doge Dark]], [[Kory]] and [[Bun Bun Black]], as the Minotaur is contained within the [[wikipedia:Labyrinth|Labyrinth]] in Greek mythology.

